From 37f42a99239f64819a19150750b7470ff7db8733 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dario Gabriel Lipicar <dario@status.im>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 05:33:02 -0300
Subject: [PATCH 2/4] feat(sync): updates before the tip, and the height
 scanned

UpdateSubscriber::checkpoint_every(n) also yields an update after every n
filters checked, with the blocks they matched applied; scanned() names
the height of the last filter checked and synced() whether that update
came at the tip. A long first sync that loses its peers can go on from
there instead of starting over.
---
